  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "DSH-AMP-Radio",
      "text": "**AMP radio player** for DeepSeek Harness.\n\nA clean internet-radio player that lives in your DeepSeek Harness composer dock. Pick a station, press play, and enjoy.\n\n**Official website:** [get-amp.com](https://get-amp.com)\n\n[](https://discord.gg/hr3zfQmyVQ)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- 🎵 **Internet radio** — stream any MP3/OGG stream\n- 📊 **Live visualizer** — real-time frequency bars in the pill and panel\n- ⭐ **Favorites** — star stations, they stick\n- 🔍 **Search** — filter stations instantly\n- 🪟 **Pill + panel** — compact pill in the dock, full panel for browsing"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Install it from inside DeepSeek Harness — no files to move, works on **Windows, macOS and Linux**.\n\n1. Open the **Plugins** panel in DeepSeek Harness.\n2. Click **Add plugin**.\n3. Paste the repo URL: `https://github.com/tonyous/DSH-AMP-Radio`\n4. Click **Install**.\n\nThat's it — the **AMP** pill appears in your composer dock."
    },
    {
      "section": "Using it",
      "text": "1. Click the **AMP pill** in the composer dock to open the panel.\n2. Pick a station (or type in the search box).\n3. Press **play** — the music starts and the visualizer lights up."
    },
    {
      "section": "Keyboard shortcuts",
      "text": "| Key | Action |\n|-----|--------|\n| `Space` | Play / pause |\n| `Esc` | Close panel |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Links",
      "text": "- **Official website:** [get-amp.com](https://get-amp.com)\n- **Join us on Discord:** [discord.gg/hr3zfQmyVQ](https://discord.gg/hr3zfQmyVQ)\n- **GitHub:** [tonyous/DSH-AMP-Radio](https://github.com/tonyous/DSH-AMP-Radio)"
    },
    {
